</USER_REQUEST>

<GROUND_TRUTH>
The two enzymes implicated are **PI3 kinase** and **IKK (IκB kinase)**.  
- **PI3 kinase** is implicated because wortmannin and Ly294002 are known inhibitors of this enzyme.  
- **IKK** is implicated because BX795 is an inhibitor of this kinase, which is part of the pathway leading to the activation of the transcription factor **NF-κB**.  
