Substituting the number of moles in the first solution:  
\[20 + 6.00 \times V_2 = 60 \)  
\[6.00 V_2 = 60 - 20 = 40 \text{ mol}\)  
\[V_2 = \frac{40}{6.00} = 6.67 \text{ L}\)  
