- \(T\) is the temperature in Kelvin (37 °C = 300 K).  
- \([A]\) and \([B]\) are the concentrations of the products (ADP and Pi).  
- \([B]_1\) and \([A]_1\) are the concentrations of the reactants (ATP and H₂O).  

